---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="cursed" title="Cursed Events" active="cursed-events" pageMark="🐈‍⬛">
  Everything the <strong>Cursed</strong> <a href={`${base}traits`}>trait</a> touches, and there is
  more of it than there is of Blessing. The first group <strong>requires</strong> the trait, and it
  covers crop failures, fires, earthquakes, poor iron and royal tragedies that can only happen to a
  character who is already Cursed. Others <strong>grant</strong> the trait. A few do both, and those
  are the ones to look for, because Altruism, Asceticism, Carnivorism and Come to Collect can
  <strong>remove</strong> the curse from the character suffering it. Cursed and
  <a href={`${base}blessed-events`}>Blessed</a> replace one another, so gaining one clears the other.
  The page collects stories that also appear under their own event class or trigger on
  <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>. A weight is the value in the XML rather than a real
  in-game chance.
</EventGroupPage>
